OL,3,GNEWSACalls for action on bluetongue
OL,4,Aaffecting livestock
OL,5,
OL,6,FPoliticians have called for a
OL,7,Fbluetongue taskforce to be created
OL,8,Fafter hearing of issues faced by
OL,9,Ffarmers.
OL,11,FEd Davey, leader of the Liberal
OL,12,FDemocrats, called for action while
OL,13,Fmeeting Cumbrian farmers with MP for
OL,14,FWestmorland and Lonsdale Tim Farron.
OL,16,FThe Department for Environment, Food &
OL,17,FRural Affairs (Defra) has recorded
OL,18,Falmost 10 bluetongue cases in Cumbria
OL,19,Fas part of 783 across the whole of
OL,20,FEngland. The disease affects animals
OL,21,Fsuch as sheep, cattle and goats, and is
OL,22,Fmainly spread by midges.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
